{"seq":19,"slug":"ai-economics-business-models","title":"AI 商业模式与经济学","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models","rating":{"composite":3.96,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# AI 商业模式与经济学 简介\n\n大模型把智能变成了一种可计量、可计费的资源，而围绕它的定价、成本与竞争，正在重塑整个软件行业的商业逻辑。这个手册聚焦一个常被技术讨论忽略却决定成败的问题：当你把大模型接入产品时，钱是怎么花出去的、价值又是怎么挣回来的。\n\n本手册面向需要为 AI 产品做技术决策与商业判断的从业者——工程师、架构师、技术管理者，以及关心单位经济模型的创业者。理解 AI 的经济学，不只是为了控制账单，更是为了在架构选型、定价设计和长期战略上做出经得起推敲的取舍。\n\n第一章 **Token 定价与推理成本经济学** 从最底层的计量单位讲起，解释 token 如何成为 AI 时代的计价货币，输入与输出为何价格不同，推理成本由哪些因素驱动，以及如何估算和优化一次调用乃至整个产品的边际成本。\n\n第二章 **上下文窗口与长文本商业模式** 讨论上下文长度这一关键变量的经济含义：更长的窗口带来更强的能力，也带来非线性增长的成本。本章分析长文本场景的定价策略、缓存与检索等成本控制手段，以及它们如何催生新的产品形态。\n\n第三章 **自建 vs 采购与微调 ROI** 面对「调用闭源 API、托管开源模型，还是自建训练」这一核心抉择，本章给出系统的权衡框架，把固定成本与变动成本、规模拐点、微调投入与回报放在同一张账本上比较，帮助你判断何时值得自己动手。\n\n第四章 **平台竞争格局与护城河** 把视野拉到产业层面，分析模型厂商、云平台与应用层之间的价值分配，探讨什么构成 AI 时代真正的护城河——是模型能力、成本结构、数据飞轮，还是分发与生态。\n\n推荐按顺序阅读。前两章建立成本侧的微观理解，第三章把这些认知转化为关键的选型决策，第四章则把单个产品的经济账放回整个竞争格局中审视。读完你将拥有一套贯穿单位经济、技术选型与战略竞争的完整分析视角。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"token-pricing-and-inference-economics","title":"Token 定价与推理成本经济学","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/token-pricing-and-inference-economics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pricing-models-2026","title":"2026 年主流模型定价格局","url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/token-pricing-and-inference-economics/pricing-models-2026"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inference-cost-curve","title":"推理成本曲线与硬件经济","url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/token-pricing-and-inference-economics/inference-cost-curve"},{"seq":3,"slug":"prompt-caching-and-batching","title":"提示词缓存与批处理的成本杠杆","url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/token-pricing-and-inference-economics/prompt-caching-and-batching"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"context-window-and-long-text-business","title":"上下文窗口与长文本商业模式","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/context-window-and-long-text-business","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"context-scaling-economics","title":"上下文规模扩张的经济学","url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/context-window-and-long-text-business/context-scaling-economics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rag-vs-long-context-tradeoff","title":"取舍之争：RAG 与长上下文","url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/context-window-and-long-text-business/rag-vs-long-context-tradeoff"},{"seq":3,"slug":"indexing-and-retrieval-cost","title":"索引与检索的成本模型","url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/context-window-and-long-text-business/indexing-and-retrieval-cost"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"build-vs-buy-and-finetuning-roi","title":"自建 vs 采购与微调 ROI","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/build-vs-buy-and-finetuning-roi","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"build-vs-buy-framework","title":"自建与采购的决策框架","url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/build-vs-buy-and-finetuning-roi/build-vs-buy-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"finetuning-roi-model","title":"微调的 ROI 模型","url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/build-vs-buy-and-finetuning-roi/finetuning-roi-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"open-source-vs-proprietary","title":"开源与闭源模型的成本权衡","url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/build-vs-buy-and-finetuning-roi/open-source-vs-proprietary"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"platform-competition-and-moats","title":"平台竞争格局与护城河","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/platform-competition-and-moats","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"api-platform-landscape-2026","title":"API 平台竞争格局：2026 年 API 平台竞争格局","url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/platform-competition-and-moats/api-platform-landscape-2026"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vertical-saas-and-moats","title":"垂直 SaaS 与护城河侵蚀","url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/platform-competition-and-moats/vertical-saas-and-moats"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pricing-strategy-and-unit-economics","title":"定价策略与单位经济模型","url":"/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/platform-competition-and-moats/pricing-strategy-and-unit-economics"}]}]}